\n50\t  ClusterQueue) — no Distributed Workloads code change is needed for the\n51\t  quota side.\n52\t- A CSV export affordance for the displayed reports.\n53\t- Access gating consistent with the Dashboard's existing administrator /\n54\t  RBAC model, so the chargeback view is visible only to platform\n55\t  administrators.\n56\t\n57\t## Acceptance Criteria\n58\t\n59\t- The admin view shows per-project GPU-hour consumption for selectable time\n60\t  ranges, matching the figures served by the report API.\n61\t- The current-month view shows each project's consumption against its Kueue\n62\t  quota, and the quota figures reconcile with the Kueue quota model (this\n63\t  validates the Distributed Workloads side, which is consumed read-only).\n64\t- Reports can be exported as CSV from the view.\n65\t- The chargeback view is accessible only to platform administrators.\n66\t- Changes build and pass tests in the Dashboard's existing Konflux pipeline.\n67\t\n68\t## HLR Traceability\n69\t\n70\t- HLR-1 (P0): administrators can view per-project GPU-hour consumption reports\n71\t  over selectable time ranges.\n72\t- HLR-3 (P1, bundled): the current-month consumption-vs-quota display is a\n73\t  presentation mode of the same administrator view and the same per-project\n74\t  data as the HLR-1 report list — it shares the UI surface and is not\n75\t  separately schedulable, so it ships with the report view.\n76\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b4323ccb0522a253","agent_id":"a703a1e8fc5574bf6","session_id":"93310d5d-28f6-44a7-9cad-8975610828da","uuid":"9dced03b-6fa9-4e29-b875-64c5e78675ad","timestamp":"2026-10-26T18:21:27.705Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-972b44ea57a2fc04","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9018 decomposition"}
